      "mergeID": "61482718ca22cf3a022faa69",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Would it be possible to add a text chat feature? For disabled people, people who are uncomfortable with their voice, or with talking, or are shy.\nYou could make it something optional so it won't bother players that don't want it, like a button to hide it and to show it, something simple.\nNot having a text chat really makes it harder to socialize to a lot of people, it becoming a feature would help out a lot.\nMaybe with TTS as a additional feature you can enable for specific players you'd want to listen to their messages.",
