      "statusChangeID": "634ef81ca3670f0c0187d078",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "Woah, I get to close a request from before I played VRChat.\nAnyways, we have a text chatbox now that you can use. Open your Action Menu, go to Options, then go to Chatbox. (Easier access pending)\nYou can send chat messages, and people can see the messages appear over your head. The visibility of these messages is meant to emulate voice reach (so if you can't hear someone, you can't see the messages either)\nThe messages are not logged and are ephemeral. Once they're gone, they're gone.\nWe're still improving this system, but let's go ahead and close this.",
